    <sys:String x:Key="Setting_wpbt-execution_Name">Windows Platform Binary Table (WPBT)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setting_wpbt-execution_Description">When enabled, WPBT allows your computer vendor to execute programs at boot time, such as anti-theft software and drivers, sometimes without user consent. Disabling this removes a potential security risk.</sys:String>
